","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/deployments","created_at":"2014-06-27T07:26:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-28T21:09:03Z","pushed_at":"2025-11-26T00:55:34Z","git_url":"git://github.com/missionpinball/mpf.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:missionpinball/mpf.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/missionpinball/mpf.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/missionpinball/mpf","homepage":"http://missionpinball.org","size":50873,"stargazers_count":243,"watchers_count":243,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":158,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":152,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["mission-pinball-framework","mpf","pinball","python"],"visibility":"public","forks":158,"open_issues":152,"watchers":243,"default_branch":"dev","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/pulls/1067","html_url":"https://github.com/missionpinball/mpf/pull/1067","diff_url":"https://github.com/missionpinball/mpf/pull/1067.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/missionpinball/mpf/pull/1067.patch","merged_at":"2018-01-18T20:50:25Z"},"body":"This PR adds functionality in `event_player` to support the use of conditions on event _handlers_ in addition to the triggers. For example:\r\n\r\n```\r\nreenable_nonrecruit_modes:\r\n    - start_mode_shadowbroker_base\r\n    - start_mode_n7_assignments\r\n    # Prior to collectorship, enable overlord; afterwards, enable arrival\r\n    - start_mode_overlordlight{device.achievements.collectorship.state!=\"complete\"}\r\n    - start_mode_arrival{device.achievements.collectorship.state==\"complete\"}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis update also includes conditional support for asset pools (e.g. `sound_pools`) that evaluate the inclusion of assets during random/sequential selection:\r\n```\r\nsound_pools:\r\n  randomsquad_recruitcomplete:\r\n    type: random\r\n    track: voice\r\n    sounds:\r\n      - missioncomplete_voice_miranda\r\n      - missioncomplete_voice_jack\r\n      - missioncomplete_voice_garrus{current_player.status_garrus<=1}\r\n      - missioncomplete_voice_jack{current_player.status_jack<=1}\r\n      - missioncomplete_voice_grunt{current_player.status_grunt<=1}\r\n      - missioncomplete_voice_mordin{current_player.status_mordin<=1}\r\n      - missioncomplete_voice_samara{current_player.status_samara<=1}\r\n ```\r\n\r\n### THE LOGIC\r\nThis PR adds a new method to `placeholder_manager` called `parse_conditional_template()`, which standardizes the parsing of a template string (e.g. _\"some_event_name{condition!=False}|2\"_) that was previously duplicated across players. This method returns a dictionary object as follows:\r\n```\r\nparse_dict = { \r\n    name: \"some_event_name\", \r\n    condition: <BoolTemplate 'condition!=False'>, \r\n    number: 2\r\n}\r\n```\r\nThe method supports an optional keyword argument `default_number`. If provided, the method will attempt to type-conform the template's number value to match the `default_number` type, or populate the default value if the template has no number specified. If not provided, the method will return the template's number value in its original string form (e.g. _\"500ms\"_)\r\n\r\n### THE IMPLEMENTATION\r\nThe `parse_conditional_template` method is implemented in `EventPlayer` to determine whether each event handler in a list should be posted, and is done in realtime so that condition changes mid-mode are always reflected. Currently the event player parses the handler strings every time the trigger is activated, but future work might store the parsed strings (with names, conditions, and delays) the way asset pools do.\r\n\r\nThe `parse_conditional_template` method is also implemented in `AssetPool` to determine which assets should be considered during random/sequential selection. The condition templates are instantiated on init but evaluated when an asset is requested from the pool, so condition changes mid-mode are always reflected. If a pool has no conditional assets, all conditional logic is bypassed (for speed).\r\n\r\nBasic handling is provided for pools in which every asset condition is false, but this scenario has not been thoroughly tested (and should probably be discouraged).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/issues/1067/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/missionpinball/mpf/issues/1067/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]